[[ HOW TO USE THIS FILE
Replace {Project}, {Writer}, {Date}, {Email} on the title page.
Keep the Act / Sequence headings — they build the outline.
Write scenes under the sequence they belong to.
[[Notes]] do not print. Action and dialogue do.
Delete this note when you no longer need it. ]]

